1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,500
I wasn't sure you'd come.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,500
I almost stayed away.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Is that your idea of an apology?

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,500
No. This is me trying to tell the truth.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,500
You left without saying goodbye.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,500
I thought leaving would keep you safe.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
You didn't get to make that choice for me.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,500
You're right. I was afraid.

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,500
The last train leaves in ten minutes.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,500
Then I have ten minutes to earn your trust.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,500
Trust isn't a ticket you can buy.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,500
I know. I'm asking for a chance.
